        end
        box class="h-11 flex-row items-center gap-3 bg-[#1a1b25] px-4" note="将 TrueHD / DTS-HD / E-AC3 原始码流送至功放解码"
          text "音频直通" class="flex-1 text-sm text-zinc-50"
